  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/1b1b3ea0c58f3d08aa6b9e43ffe6e02a032cbb8d0640c4926cdca1bc249d9a56.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
